---
// ON THE BACK BURNER (Nov 4, 2026): not mounted. Swap <HeroCompanions /> for
// <HeroWearables /> in pages/index.astro to bring the device lineup back.
// Hero devices: one studio render (GPT Image 2.5) of the lineup, so lighting,
// scale and angles match. The real Cortisol+ watch captures are composited
// onto the two screens: Pebble on the square watch, Bloom on the round watch.
// The Fitbit Air and the ring have no display. Sources and the compositing
// script: apps/cortisol-marketing/hero-devices/. Simulator sample data.
---

<img
  src="/app-ui/devices/lineup.webp"
  alt="Cortisol+ on a square smartwatch showing Pebble at Low 22 and a round smartwatch showing Bloom at Normal 42, beside a screenless fitness band and a smart ring. Example values."
  width="1200"
  height="802"
  fetchpriority="high"
  decoding="async"
  class="hero-lineup"
/>

<style>
  .hero-lineup {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 26rem;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0.5rem auto 0;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 22px 26px rgba(30, 70, 110, 0.22));
    animation: lineup-float 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes lineup-float { 50% { translate: 0 -5px; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-lineup { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
